# Copy to `.env.development` in this folder if you need overrides.
#
# Vite proxies `/api/*` to Talky's control server. That server must be running
# (`bun run start` from the repo root, or any process that listens on WEB_UI_PORT).
#
# Proxy target resolution (first match wins):
#   1. `VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET` in web-ui/.env*
#   2. `http://127.0.0.1:${WEB_UI_PORT}` — WEB_UI_PORT is read from repo root `.env` or web-ui `.env*`
#   3. default port 4173
#
# `ECONNREFUSED` on the proxy means nothing is listening on that host/port (Talky not started,
# or WEB_UI_PORT / VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET does not match the running server).
#
# Use http:// only. https:// causes TLS / "wrong version number" / https-proxy style errors because
# Talky's control server speaks HTTP, not HTTPS.

# Full URL (clearest when Talky is not on localhost:4173):
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:4173

# Talky control port (same variable as repo root `.env` — now picked up by Vite):
# WEB_UI_PORT=4173
